OL,3,GNEWSATrust marks 5,000th robotic
OL,4,Asurgery milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust has marked a "major
OL,7,Fmilestone" after its 5,000th patient
OL,8,Funderwent innovative robotic surgery.
OL,10,FThe Da Vinci robot was first used by
OL,11,FHull University Teaching Hospitals NHS
OL,12,FTrust in 2015 and was initially used by
OL,13,Fits urology team to perform minimally
OL,14,Finvasive procedures for conditions like
OL,15,Fprostate cancer.
OL,17,FNow five other specialities `
OL,18,Fgynae-oncology, thoracic surgery,
OL,19,Fcolorectal, upper gastrointestinal and
OL,20,Fhead and neck ` also offer the
OL,21,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
