OL,3,GNEWSATrust marks 5,000th robotic
OL,4,Asurgery milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Sedman, deputy group chief
OL,7,Fmedical officer, said: "The
OL,8,Fintroduction of robotic surgery was a
OL,9,Fgame-changer for our patients 11 years
OL,10,Fago."
